  "goodToKnow": "Das Paradoxon (also das Paradox) is a paradox: ein logisches Paradoxon, das Paradoxon von Achilles und der Schildkröte (Zeno). The Greek plural is die Paradoxa, though Paradoxien and Paradoxe also occur. Paradox is also an adjective: eine paradoxe Situation, and paradoxerweise means paradoxically. From Greek para (against) and doxa (opinion)."
